{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NFCSmartCardConnection"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The  NFCSmartCardConnection is short lived and should be closed as soon as the commands sent to the YubiKey have finished processing. It is up to the user of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the connection to close it when it no longer is needed. As long as the connection is open the NFC modal will cover the lower part of the iPhone screen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection\/close(error:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" method defined in the SmartCardConnection protocol the NFCSmartCardConnection has an additional ","type":"text"},{"code":"close(success:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method that will close the connection and set the alertMessage of the NFC alert to the provided message.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC is only supported on iPhones from iPhone 6 and forward. It will not work on iPads since there’s no NFC chip in these devices.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connection to a YubiKey (iOS only).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFCSmartCardConnection establishes a connection to a YubiKey via NFC. The connection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents the system NFC dialog and waits for the user to tap their YubiKey.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connections are short-lived due to iOS timeout constraints. Perform operations quickly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and close the connection with a user-visible message.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection(","    alertMessage: \"Hold your YubiKey near the phone\"",")","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()","await connection.close(message: \"Codes retrieved\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NFCSmartCardConnection"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:7YubiKit22NFCSmartCardConnectionV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NFCSmartCardConnection"}],"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"title":"NFCSmartCardConnection","role":"symbol"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Connection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/SmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection\/init()","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection\/init(alertMessage:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection\/setAlertMessage(_:)"],"anchor":"Creating-a-Connection","title":"Creating a Connection"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentatio